# Treat binary assets as binary (no LFS on this repo)
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary

# PowerShell scripts run on the Windows box under PowerShell 5.1, which assumes
# the system ANSI codepage for a .ps1 with no byte-order mark and mis-decodes
# every non-ASCII byte in the comments. These files are stored WITH a UTF-8 BOM
# and CRLF endings; -text keeps git from rewriting either on checkout.
*.ps1 -text
